  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl">Open Camera Mouse</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-lg">
    Control the mouse pointer with your head, using an ordinary webcam.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-muted">
    This website is being built. Until then, the <a href={REPO_URL} class="text-text"
      >project on GitHub</a
    > has installation and usage instructions.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
